# `neon deploy` እነዚህን ወደ .env.local ያወርዳል። በVercel ላይ እራስዎ ያስገቡ።
# DATABASE_URL የpooler አድራሻ፣ DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED ለmigration ብቻ ነው።
DATABASE_URL=""
DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=""

# ረጅም የዘፈቀደ ጽሑፍ፦ node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=""
# በLocal: http://localhost:3000  | በVercel: የድረ-ገጹ ሙሉ አድራሻ
BETTER_AUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Google Cloud Console -> Credentials -> OAuth client ID
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""

# የአድሚን ፈቃድ የሚያገኙ የGmail አድራሻዎች፣ በኮማ የተለዩ
ADMIN_EMAILS=""

# Telegram monitoring (docs/telegram-setup.md)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
TELEGRAM_OWNER_CHAT_IDS=""
TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CONTACTS=""
TELEGRAM_REPORT_LOCALE="am"
CRON_SECRET=""
SITE_URL=""
